OL,3,GNEWSA'Big Brother' and AI fears over
OL,4,Alecture filming
OL,5,
OL,6,FA university policy making it
OL,7,Fcompulsory to film lectures has raised
OL,8,Fconcerns about the footage being
OL,9,Fmisused or used to train artificial
OL,10,Fintelligence (AI), unions said.
OL,12,FThe University of Lincoln said it was
OL,13,F"standard practice" for lectures to be
OL,14,Ffilmed, and confirmed that was a change
OL,15,Ffrom it being "best practice" in the
OL,16,Fprevious academic year.
OL,18,FThe university said the policy would
OL,19,Fensure "all students have access to the
OL,20,Fteaching materials and support they
OL,21,Fneed to succeed".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
