OL,3,GNEWSA'Big Brother' and AI fears over
OL,4,Alecture filming
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, Lincoln and Districts Trades
OL,7,FCouncil said the policy was like a "big
OL,8,Fbrother state", while the University
OL,9,Fand College Union said its members were
OL,10,Fconcerned the content could be
OL,11,Frepurposed by AI without consent.
